{"lines":[{"x":0.084775088587678862,"h":0.01744186102384615,"y":0.062499999702466447,"w":0.20069203694661458,"c":1,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"y":0.11046511625587263,"x":0.083044984772053854,"w":0.30449826558430987,"h":0.021802325612435891,"c":1,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 1"},{"c":1,"w":0.60218261718749999,"x":0.084708879367703951,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 5.5 score.","y":0.14705267439529202,"h":0.019537260350520391},{"y":0.1773255811125094,"t":"How is the process for rain-shadow appears in deserts the image below is the","w":0.62975779215494787,"c":1,"h":0.017565951470814856,"x":0.084775083097866188},{"h":0.019835469437446296,"y":0.19681101695720127,"w":0.59699651082356775,"x":0.084715334512302384,"c":1,"t":"explanation about the formation of rain-shadow in this desert in specific"},{"y":0.22813156032817938,"x":0.084775082991520687,"h":0.014695591322603119,"c":1,"t":"The first that i can see is the thousand of kilometeres between the sea and the inland","w":0.6989619445800781},{"c":1,"t":"behind the mountains. This is important because the process have a lot of steps and the","h":0.017562900246899771,"x":0.084775075405247549,"y":0.24842547212137478,"w":0.71972320556640623},{"c":1,"y":0.27034883691943024,"x":0.084775087362462642,"w":0.27335639953613283,"t":"distance gives time to all of them","h":0.017614773722942845},{"w":0.69723185221354167,"h":0.018985873756915961,"c":1,"t":"First of all, the clouds are formed because the winds from the sea arrove to the coast","x":0.084775077265904789,"y":0.29941860467939985},{"x":0.084725404148216513,"y":0.3186839836469566,"t":"and grow up until the top of mountain while the moist air are rise and cool. Moreover on","w":0.72327931722005212,"h":0.02009328250871667,"c":1},{"h":0.017514077327399957,"y":0.34149755085115518,"c":1,"x":0.084775086705076705,"t":"the top of mountain starts to rains.","w":0.29238754272460937},{"y":0.36908584847531412,"w":0.67483673095703123,"t":"Then, the dry air continues over the mountain until the below part. This part saids","h":0.02057198563850049,"c":1,"x":0.084732404844831757},{"x":0.083044976767727693,"h":0.020643806857942648,"w":0.70588236490885414,"t":"inland areas finally, in this part when the dry winds founds the inland areas, the rain-","y":0.39083274999734985,"c":1},{"x":0.084597740459061613,"w":0.194130007425944,"h":0.017459299449239962,"c":1,"y":0.4133876176279796,"t":"shadow desert appears"},{"w":0.27162628173828129,"y":0.44912790722962592,"h":0.014534882851794828,"c":1,"x":0.086505199074630973,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:"},{"y":0.47093023258371902,"x":0.12629756748945198,"t":"This response addressed the requirements of the task but, overall, there is a lack","w":0.66608998616536463,"h":0.018922811792479122,"c":1},{"y":0.48914454255873774,"x":0.12591624958737635,"t":"of detail.","h":0.01720057541544906,"w":0.078758614857991543,"c":1},{"w":0.62987559000651039,"t":"The first paragraph is an introduction to the diagram. Task 1 Academic tasks","x":0.12623691871521639,"h":0.019358967967263552,"c":1,"y":0.5153832986503244},{"w":0.6195655822753906,"h":0.020813879889988063,"t":"require an overview, a summary ot the key stages ot the process, but this is","y":0.53445636689463827,"x":0.12621881680772029,"c":1},{"w":0.62641347249348966,"c":1,"x":0.12796950042816016,"y":0.55204177080610517,"t":"missing. Paragraph 2 contains some irrelevant information [This is important","h":0.019345517755806063},{"c":1,"t":"because the process have a lot of steps and the distance gives time to all of","x":0.12622705932730716,"y":0.5697315002106611,"h":0.02093867708370345,"w":0.62992757161458335},{"y":0.5876560042541884,"t":"them. The main response comes in paragraphs 3 and 4 and it does include the","h":0.021967837158160419,"x":0.12619868268372936,"w":0.654186045328776,"c":1},{"w":0.68195765177408851,"x":0.12617429074541461,"t":"main features, but there are details missing, such as 'clouds form' 'Windward side'","y":0.60458149246491821,"c":1,"h":0.024301794544644428},{"t":"and 'Leeward side'. The irrelevant content and missing details detract from the","x":0.12629757248976214,"y":0.62631210603972098,"w":0.65224914550781254,"h":0.017583243074410393,"c":1},{"y":0.64520643814716627,"t":"score for this task.","h":0.016130771063023075,"x":0.12456747380326358,"w":0.15570934295654296,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.64705881754557293,"x":0.12456748184140015,"t":"Information is generally arranged coherently and there are linking expressions","y":0.67004898499061538,"h":0.018904503114245186},{"w":0.63321797688802084,"c":1,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"[First of all | Moreover | Then] and some referencing within the process [this","x":0.12283737846382223,"y":0.68894331731991754},{"y":0.70783764843923047,"c":1,"t":"desert | all of them | this part]. There is some repetition [The first | First of all] but","x":0.12629758198998731,"w":0.67820068359374996,"h":0.017494751574527512},{"w":0.46207778930664067,"c":1,"t":"overall, cohesive devices are used to some good effect.","y":0.72509308430025021,"x":0.12621835470296952,"h":0.020706093336336329},{"h":0.023684052506721121,"t":"Vocabulary is generally good and appropriate for the task [appears | explanation],","x":0.1262088937089634,"w":0.6783812967936198,"c":1,"y":0.74856391248201604},{"t":"the meaning is clear but there are errors [arrove \/ arrive | grow up \/ move up |","x":0.12624318094370551,"y":0.76887212905640501,"h":0.020650634071558316,"w":0.6471851094563803,"c":1},{"h":0.017613756648304557,"c":1,"w":0.65743942260742194,"t":"saids \/ sees] and a lack of precision [in specific \/ specitically | gives time | below","x":0.1262975896480926,"y":0.78924418576466215},{"h":0.021660036603581845,"w":0.659327392578125,"t":"part]. Similarly, the grammatical range is narrow, often inaccurate and repetitive","x":0.12621154518486113,"c":1,"y":0.80541354860205971},{"t":"but the writer does attempt multi clause sentences [while | when] and a modal","x":0.1262975961357635,"h":0.019020456296735211,"c":1,"y":0.82400279924998576,"w":0.65051900227864579},{"c":1,"t":"verb [can] so there is some ability. Overall though, grammatical errors are frequent","h":0.02050956702048834,"y":0.84278477270357999,"w":0.68524063110351563,"x":0.1262403911123359},{"y":0.85838591909359574,"w":0.43094314575195314,"c":1,"t":"and they do cause some difficulty in understanding.","h":0.022730131262745146,"x":0.1262015627429405},{"w":0.66797022501627601,"x":0.12622691008458342,"y":0.88667996706181951,"t":"To achieve a higher score, an overview, which summarises the main stages of the","h":0.021690753058506207,"c":1},{"x":0.10899653754966636,"h":0.017494751574527623,"w":0.2647058868408203,"c":1,"y":0.90692792164227054,"t":"process should be presented."},{"y":0.96075581364800977,"c":1,"t":"132","h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.088235293725554609,"w":0.031141869227091459}],"w":2400,"h":2857}